WEBVTT

00:00:15.737 --> 00:00:17.740
<v><b>Emma:</b></v> Hello, stranger!

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:19.100
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Emma!

00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:21.300
<v><b>Emma:</b></v> Sorry I’m late.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:23.199
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Don’t worry, it’s fine.

00:00:24.121 --> 00:00:24.846
How are you?

00:00:24.953 --> 00:00:27.540
<v><b>Emma:</b></v> Great! It’s so nice to see you…

00:00:29.011 --> 00:00:30.278
You look a bit thin.

00:00:30.987 --> 00:00:32.140
Are you eating enough?

00:00:33.020 --> 00:00:35.020
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Yes, I am.

00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:37.060
You sound like Mom.

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:41.540
Anyway, this is Carla.

00:00:41.860 --> 00:00:44.100
<v><b>Carla:</b></v> Hi. It’s nice to meet you.

00:00:44.316 --> 00:00:45.697
<v><b>Emma:</b></v> It’s nice to meet you, too.

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:55.820
<v><b>Emma:</b></v> How’s the photography course going?

00:00:55.821 --> 00:00:57.075
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> It’s great.

00:00:57.497 --> 00:01:00.398
Right now, I’m working on a really big project.

00:01:00.796 --> 00:01:04.340
It’s going well, but it’s hard work.

00:01:06.494 --> 00:01:07.979
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Hi, Izzy.

00:01:10.187 --> 00:01:13.841
This is Emma. Emma, Izzy.

00:01:14.718 --> 00:01:17.120
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Hi, Emma. It’s really nice to meet you.

00:01:17.641 --> 00:01:19.380
<v><b>Emma:</b></v> It’s so good to meet you, too.

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:22.380
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> I’ve heard a lot about you.

00:01:22.860 --> 00:01:23.879
<v><b>Emma:</b></v> Me too.

00:01:24.641 --> 00:01:26.854
Wow, that’s a really cool jacket!

00:01:26.897 --> 00:01:28.380
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Oh, thanks.

00:01:31.860 --> 00:01:32.486
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Coffee?

00:01:32.958 --> 00:01:35.580
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Yeah. A flat white, please.

00:01:48.580 --> 00:01:51.300
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> So, have you seen much of London yet?

00:01:51.620 --> 00:01:52.851
<v><b>Emma:</b></v> Just the hotel room.

00:01:52.931 --> 00:01:54.820
I only arrived last night.

00:01:55.580 --> 00:01:57.942
But we’re going to go out for dinner later.

00:01:58.321 --> 00:02:00.129
Are you going to come with us?

00:02:01.905 --> 00:02:05.820
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Um… no, sorry, I can’t.

00:02:06.380 --> 00:02:09.180
I’m going out for drinks with the people from my office…

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:11.660
Um, team building…

00:02:12.340 --> 00:02:14.700
<v><b>Emma:</b></v> Oh… team building…

00:02:21.932 --> 00:02:26.105
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> … So yeah, I work long hours, but I love it.

00:02:26.548 --> 00:02:30.060
<v><b>Emma:</b></v> That’s great. Ben, Izzy can’t come with us.

00:02:30.070 --> 00:02:33.860
She needs to meet some people from work, or something?

00:02:34.870 --> 00:02:36.211
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Really, Izzy?

00:02:38.395 --> 00:02:39.580
Emma just got here.

00:02:41.100 --> 00:02:42.580
I booked a table for three.

00:02:44.220 --> 00:02:45.740
We could see some sights on the way.

00:02:46.980 --> 00:02:47.900
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> I’d love to…

00:02:48.340 --> 00:02:49.500
I’d really love to.

00:02:50.580 --> 00:02:51.860
But it’s a work thing.

00:02:53.100 --> 00:02:54.150
Everyone is going.

00:02:55.180 --> 00:02:57.540
It’s really important that I’m there.

00:02:58.980 --> 00:03:01.660
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Well… if it’s important.

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:04.940
<v><b>Emma:</b></v> It’s fine, Ben.

00:03:06.460 --> 00:03:10.660
You can’t expect Izzy to change her plans just because I’m here.

00:03:13.260 --> 00:03:15.020
It’s just you and me, then.

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:20.620
<v><b> Ben:</b></v> Do you really need to go to this work thing?

00:03:22.060 --> 00:03:22.916
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Yes.

00:03:25.374 --> 00:03:26.134
I’m sorry…

00:03:34.795 --> 00:03:37.300
Actually, I need to go now.

00:03:38.119 --> 00:03:39.640
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> But you just got here.

00:03:40.660 --> 00:03:44.195
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> I know… I just… I’m sorry.

00:03:46.060 --> 00:03:47.180
Nice to meet you, Emma.

00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:54.140
Let’s do something really soon – maybe tomorrow – the three of us?

00:03:55.617 --> 00:03:56.203
<v><b>Emma:</b></v> Sure.